From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Wait for native GX and clear pipelines before hardware work
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: permanent native compiler/hardware execution adaptation.

Actual GX/Clear requests must execute at their FIFO positions. Use Aurora's
existing Blocking compiler queue and reject an absent compiled main pipeline;
otherwise the unchanged consumers can silently omit the draw/clear while a
Normal-priority native pipeline is still compiling. Preserve queue/cache keys,
worker creation, remembered configurations, layouts and background warming.
No original game source, behavior, ABI or resource request is changed.

diff --git a/lib/gfx/pipeline_cache.cpp b/lib/gfx/pipeline_cache.cpp
--- a/lib/gfx/pipeline_cache.cpp
+++ b/lib/gfx/pipeline_cache.cpp
@@ -1089,12 +1089,22 @@
 
 PipelineRef find_pipeline(const clear::PipelineConfig& config, const RenderTargetLayout& layout) {
   remember_pipeline_config(ShaderType::Clear, config, current_frame(), true);
-  return resolve_pipeline(ShaderType::Clear, config, layout, PipelinePriority::Normal);
+  // A hardware draw/clear must execute at this FIFO position. An unfinished
+  // native pipeline is a compilation wait, never permission to drop the draw.
+  const auto ref = resolve_pipeline(ShaderType::Clear, config, layout, PipelinePriority::Blocking);
+  CompiledPipeline compiled;
+  AURORA_ASSERT(get_pipeline(ref, compiled), "Native Clear pipeline did not compile");
+  return ref;
 }
 
 PipelineRef find_pipeline(const gx::PipelineConfig& config, const RenderTargetLayout& layout) {
   remember_pipeline_config(ShaderType::GX, config, current_frame(), true);
-  return resolve_pipeline(ShaderType::GX, config, layout, PipelinePriority::Normal);
+  // A hardware draw/clear must execute at this FIFO position. An unfinished
+  // native pipeline is a compilation wait, never permission to drop the draw.
+  const auto ref = resolve_pipeline(ShaderType::GX, config, layout, PipelinePriority::Blocking);
+  CompiledPipeline compiled;
+  AURORA_ASSERT(get_pipeline(ref, compiled), "Native GX pipeline did not compile");
+  return ref;
 }
 
